### Test Guest Users Endpoint

### 1. Test endpoint chính - Lấy danh sách guest users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/guests?page=1&limit=10&keyword=test
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Test endpoint với search keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/guests?keyword=guest&page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Test endpoint với pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/guests?page=2&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Test endpoint với sorting
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/guests?sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Test endpoint với filter is_verified
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/guests?is_verified=true&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Test endpoint với filter date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/guests?createdFrom=2024-01-01&createdTo=2024-12-31&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Expected Results:
# - Endpoint trả về danh sách guest users
# - Chỉ có users với role = 'guest'
# - Hỗ trợ search, pagination, sorting, filtering
# - Permission: booking.create

### Variables cho test
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
# @authToken = your_jwt_token_with_booking.create_permission
